  "actual_delta": [
    "One opaque original ZIP slice replaces one whole SELECTED JSON framing target; external original inner size/SHA and CUSTODY/SELECTED pins are enforced.",
    "Nineteen exact ranges and a required --partition bind root suffix, worker argv, setup/context, worker report and output manifest. The complete plan is recomputed by the frozen pure selector.",
    "Worker reads and seals the whole original inner ZIP before and after producing its interval, without opening it as an archive.",
    "Finalizer first uses the unchanged bound closed_ECHILD gate, then independently seals the complete inner original and compares actual interval bytes. The helper-only actual_bytes_independently_read field is explicitly checked while its remaining exact projection matches file_record.",
    "The full small-ZIP independent retention, partial download preservation, zero retries, credentials boundary, original900+3 owner,512KiB raw/1MiB stdout,448+64KiB reservations, and late durable END remain.",
    "Workflow matrix max-parallel2/fail-fastfalse and19 literal string ids; each upload has a unique partition suffix. The original product workflows are unchanged.",
    "No group may claim whole-archive custody. Nineteen complete unique matching results plus final external whole-ZIP SHA precede any future decompression."
  ],
